Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{bonusLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### B1 - Reuse old refresh token after rotation - expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{bonusLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### B2 - Logout with new refresh token - expect 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### B2 - Reuse logged-out refresh token - expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}


